{"4529850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Runeward Online", "steam_appid": 4529850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/dda97372b84a5465a04e8714675504b4.avif?t=1786649340\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras_big/dda97372b84a5465a04e8714675504b4.webp?t=1786649340 width=1560 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are a Runeward</strong>, a <strong>dungeon diver</strong> in a world overrun by monsters. Together with other players, you fight through sewers, ruins, and castles where <strong>bullets and enemies never stop coming</strong>. Along the way, you’ll find <strong>ancient artifacts - weapons, pets, and runes</strong> that can completely change your character. Bring them back, <strong>trade with other players</strong>, <strong>experiment with new synergies</strong>, and <strong>prepare for your next descent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/10787169629c2808dbbf0d35e6d6b99d.poster.avif?t=1786649340\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/10787169629c2808dbbf0d35e6d6b99d.webm?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/10787169629c2808dbbf0d35e6d6b99d.mp4?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE BULLETHELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast, cast, and dodge</strong> through <strong>procedurally generated runs of handcrafted rooms</strong>. Survival demands quick thinking - hesitation is death. Every narrow escape is rewarded with the <strong>rare loot</strong> you will need to <strong>push your character further</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/b79738ea6eddec1b9adab4ce3cf4226a.poster.avif?t=1786649340\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/b79738ea6eddec1b9adab4ce3cf4226a.webm?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/b79738ea6eddec1b9adab4ce3cf4226a.mp4?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR LOADOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just upgrade your character; evolve them. Every piece of gear you find is a potential build-defining tool:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets are not just companions</strong>, they are weapon modifiers. Make bullets bounce, duplicate, or track your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runes fundamentally transform your character</strong>, growing wings to fly over pits or reversing knockback to pull in enemies instead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a massive arsenal of weapons</strong>, ranging from ancient spellbooks that rain fire to heavy greatswords that cleave through your foes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/cfd06e297fd5782beb563147486070a8.poster.avif?t=1786649340\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/cfd06e297fd5782beb563147486070a8.webm?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/cfd06e297fd5782beb563147486070a8.mp4?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERSISTENT ONLINE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alongside dozens of other Runewards in a <strong>fully online world</strong>. Chat, trade, party up, and fight together. Death may end the fight, but your <strong>progress is persistent</strong>. Your levels, gear, and loadouts stay with you, run after run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFTED WITH LOVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runeward is made by two developers</strong> over the course of multiple years. With no external investors, we’re free to focus on what matters most: building a deep, replayable online bullet hell RPG for all to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/423358f3ea82b2368033a8d876192dcc.avif?t=1786649340\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras_big/423358f3ea82b2368033a8d876192dcc.webp?t=1786649340 width=1560 height=90 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/dda97372b84a5465a04e8714675504b4.avif?t=1786649340\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras_big/dda97372b84a5465a04e8714675504b4.webp?t=1786649340 width=1560 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are a Runeward</strong>, a <strong>dungeon diver</strong> in a world overrun by monsters. Together with other players, you fight through sewers, ruins, and castles where <strong>bullets and enemies never stop coming</strong>. Along the way, you’ll find <strong>ancient artifacts - weapons, pets, and runes</strong> that can completely change your character. Bring them back, <strong>trade with other players</strong>, <strong>experiment with new synergies</strong>, and <strong>prepare for your next descent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/10787169629c2808dbbf0d35e6d6b99d.poster.avif?t=1786649340\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/10787169629c2808dbbf0d35e6d6b99d.webm?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/10787169629c2808dbbf0d35e6d6b99d.mp4?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE BULLETHELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast, cast, and dodge</strong> through <strong>procedurally generated runs of handcrafted rooms</strong>. Survival demands quick thinking - hesitation is death. Every narrow escape is rewarded with the <strong>rare loot</strong> you will need to <strong>push your character further</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/b79738ea6eddec1b9adab4ce3cf4226a.poster.avif?t=1786649340\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/b79738ea6eddec1b9adab4ce3cf4226a.webm?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/b79738ea6eddec1b9adab4ce3cf4226a.mp4?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR LOADOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just upgrade your character; evolve them. Every piece of gear you find is a potential build-defining tool:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets are not just companions</strong>, they are weapon modifiers. Make bullets bounce, duplicate, or track your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runes fundamentally transform your character</strong>, growing wings to fly over pits or reversing knockback to pull in enemies instead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a massive arsenal of weapons</strong>, ranging from ancient spellbooks that rain fire to heavy greatswords that cleave through your foes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/cfd06e297fd5782beb563147486070a8.poster.avif?t=1786649340\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/cfd06e297fd5782beb563147486070a8.webm?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/cfd06e297fd5782beb563147486070a8.mp4?t=1786649340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERSISTENT ONLINE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alongside dozens of other Runewards in a <strong>fully online world</strong>. Chat, trade, party up, and fight together. Death may end the fight, but your <strong>progress is persistent</strong>. Your levels, gear, and loadouts stay with you, run after run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFTED WITH LOVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runeward is made by two developers</strong> over the course of multiple years. With no external investors, we’re free to focus on what matters most: building a deep, replayable online bullet hell RPG for all to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras/423358f3ea82b2368033a8d876192dcc.avif?t=1786649340\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/extras_big/423358f3ea82b2368033a8d876192dcc.webp?t=1786649340 width=1560 height=90 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Free-to-play online RPG meets relentless bullet hell. Blast, cast, and dodge as you chase rare loot, evolve your class, and bend the rules with game-breaking runes and pets. Squad up with players worldwide while delving into unforgiving dungeons and building your character, one drop at a time.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/ece1fe4b970d6b827819b299e441613c75b2429c/header.jpg?t=1786649340", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/c2c4d61f23a8d8d5ba067b98d4b70bf348fa5f36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786649340", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529850/c2c4d61f23a8d8d5ba067b98d4b70bf348fa5f36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786649340", "website": "https://runeward.online", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>